  - subnational economics
abstract: >
  Annual district-level (kabupaten/kota) PDRB (Produk Domestik Regional Bruto)
  for Indonesia, 1996–2025, harmonized to 2000-vintage administrative boundaries.
  Parsed from 21 BPS published PDFs, with 2000-boundary harmonization,
  chain-linking across three base-year regimes, and a fully reproducible pipeline.
